Task 4

Categorize post bp (optimal ≤ 120, borderline 120 &lt; bp ≤ 130, high &gt; 130)


1. Create new column status

bp_list$treatment$status &lt;- character(20)
bp_list$placebo$status &lt;- character(10)



2. Categorize non-placebo with for loops and if/then/else statements

for (i in 1:20) {

  x &lt;- bp_list$treatment$post_bp[i]

  if (x &lt;= 120) {
    bp_list$treatment$status[i] &lt;- "optimal"
  } 

  else if (x &gt; 130) {
    bp_list$treatment$status[i] &lt;- "high"
  } 

  else {
    bp_list$treatment$status[i] &lt;- "borderline"
  }

}



3. Repeat for placebo data

for (i in 1:10) {

  x &lt;- bp_list$placebo$post_bp[i]

  if (x &lt;= 120) {
    bp_list$placebo$status[i] &lt;- "optimal"
  } 

  else if (x &gt; 130) {
    bp_list$placebo$status[i] &lt;- "high"
  } 

  else {
    bp_list$placebo$status[i] &lt;- "borderline"
  }

}
